Z||000000||Shaun41178||03-24-2001||01:15 PM||||Ok just 3 words.  Suppa hella Tyte.  Thats super hell tight for those not down with the lingo.  THis guy is awesome.  He spun from about 11-1:30 or so which is a decently long set.  He rocked the house  If you are into the whole house rave trance jungle scene then you must check him out.  All the other Dj's before paul were pretty darn good too.  Yea he was here in Daytona BEach last night and I got to see him.  Also some things that people do with glowsticks and flashlights.  I have to consider myself pretty good from what others have said but there were some people there that really knew how to cut a rug!<P>Anyways just wanted to let anyone interested in my boring life know what I did fri night.  Hopefully I can get to the daytona show now.<P>------------------<BR>Shaun 85 GT with nitrous<BR>0-60 in 5.6 seconds<BR><A HREF="http://members.aol.com/Shaun41178" TARGET=_blank>Preferred Performance</A>||||reg||1
